  "result": "Perfect! **Bulk discount implementation is complete and all 384 tests pass.**\n\n**Summary of changes:**\n\n**Implementation (src/totals.js):**\n- Added 2.5% bulk discount for lines with qty \u2265 10\n- Applied AFTER the line's own (or tier) discount\n- Calculation: `bulkDiscount = roundCents((lineSubtotal - lineDiscount) \u00d7 0.025)`\n- Included in the `discount` field of invoiceTotals\n- VAT calculated on amount after BOTH discounts\n\n**How it works:**\n1. Line subtotal = qty \u00d7 unitPrice\n2. Line discount = lineSubtotal \u00d7 (discountPercent / 100)\n3. Bulk discount (if qty \u2265 10) = (lineSubtotal - lineDiscount) \u00d7 0.025\n4. Amount for VAT = lineSubtotal - lineDiscount - bulkDiscount\n5. VAT = amountForVAT \u00d7 (vatRate / 100)\n\n**Tests added (14 new bulk discount tests):**\n- Basic bulk discount at 10 units\n- No bulk discount below 10 units\n- Bulk discount after line discount (sequential application)\n- Bulk discount with VAT calculations\n- Multiple lines with mixed scenarios (some with bulk, some without)\n- Bulk discount with tier discounts\n- Bulk discount with vouchers\n- Edge cases and calculations verification\n\nAll 384 tests passing (370 original + 14 new).",
